      {
        "h_title": "Sala Ayutthaya",
        "main_title": "The best hotels in Ayutthaya",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Ayutthaya\n(Pratu Chai Phra Nakhon Si Ayutthaya)",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Breathtaking modern design meets ancient history at Sala Ayutthaya’s boutique offering on the banks of the Chao Phraya river. White on white rooms are the essence of cool with plenty of glass, freestanding tubs and simple wooden beams. An art gallery and courtyard pool are the icing on the cake.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Short break - Unwind in the historic and tranquil city of Ayutthaya on a short jaunt from Bangkok.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Local markets - Sample cheap and delicious cuisine at the floating Chao Phrom Market and Nightmarket.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Sights nearby - Explore the striking old temples of Ayutthaya that make this a World Heritage Site.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Swimming Pool - Plunge pool",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
